STO L
RCLS R.00
RCL R.09
RTN
LBL 17                          ; :WAKE:  ---- LBL :WAKE: the standby check: the calculator's clock (JD, R82 the last pass's); more than 30 s since
Date→ⅅ                          ; the last pass: the calculator was in standby, and the key that woke it ends the program cleanly (R33 = 42),
Time→ℸ                          ; so it is left in its normal state (a program left waiting went back to standby at each press). R83 = 1 -
ⅅℸ→J                            ; (IP(gap / 30 s) not 0) ----
RCL 82
X<>Y
STO 82
